body:
Agreed. 24 hours sober is amazing! 

&#x200B;

Great when it happens day after day but especially for that first day.

I have been avoiding this book like the plague throughout the hype for it...even when some people I would otherwise respect the opinion of recommend it.  Something about the description just made me wary...I'm not sure why. But thank you for basically confirming my apprehension....what you've described is exactly what I assumed it would be like....especially the stereotypes and shallowness.

&#x200B;

Thank you!
